.TH "KITCHEN" "1" "" "kitchen 1.2.3" "Kitchen"
.SH NAME
kitchen \- Exercises every feature opencligen supports
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kitchen
[options] <command>
.SH DESCRIPTION
A test CLI.
.PP
It covers types, defaults, ranges, positional arguments and metadata.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR, \fB\-v\fR
Print more
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR, \fB\-h\fR
Show help
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show the version
.SH COMMANDS
.SS "kitchen cook"
.nf
kitchen cook [options] <dish> [<servings>]
.fi
.PP
Cook a dish
.PP
Cooks the given dish with the given options.
.PP
Aliases: c.
.PP
\fBOptions:\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-heat\fR \fI<level>\fR
Heat level (int; 1..9; default: 5)
.TP
\fB\-\-timer\fR \fI<duration>\fR
(duration; default: 1m30s)
.TP
\fB\-\-style\fR \fI<style>\fR
(one of: plain, fancy; default: plain)
.TP
\fB\-\-weights\fR, \fB\-w\fR \fI<kg>...\fR
(float; >= 0; default: 0.5, 2)
.TP
\fB\-\-salt\fR \fI<bool>\fR
(boolean; default: true)
.TP
\fB\-\-batch\fR \fI<id>\fR
Required. (uint)
.PP
\fBArguments:\fR
.TP
\fIdish\fR
Required. (one of: pasta, soup, salad)
.TP
\fIservings\fR
How many people (int; 1..12)
.PP
\fBExamples:\fR
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
kitchen cook pasta 2
kitchen cook --heat 7 soup
.fi
.RE
.PP
\fBExit status:\fR
.TP
\fB0\fR
Served
.TP
\fB3\fR
Burnt
.SS "kitchen pantry"
.B kitchen pantry
[options] [<command>] [<shelf>...]
.PP
Manage the pantry
.PP
\fBArguments:\fR
.TP
\fIshelf\fR...
.SS "kitchen pantry add"
.B kitchen pantry add
[options] <item>...
.PP
Add items
.PP
This command prompts for input.
.PP
\fBArguments:\fR
.TP
\fIitem\fR...
Required.
.SH SEE ALSO
Documentation: https://example.com/docs
.br
Contact: Kitchen team, team@example.com, https://example.com
.br
